cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it and Jiang, Kelly and Xiu (2023)."
title: "Re-imagining Price-Trend OHLC Representations and Cryptocurrency Transfer"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Contributors to Reimaging-Price-Trend-OHLC-Crypto"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kola-official/Reimaging-Price-Trend-OHLC-Crypto"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-07-24"
abstract: >
  Three empirical studies under the Jiang-Kelly-Xiu (2023) image-CNN design:
  (A) US equity OHLC representation arms (raw, expand, clip);
  (B) confirmatory cryptocurrency spot retrain on Binance USDT;
  (C) frozen US raw/expand/clip transfer to cryptocurrency out-of-sample images.
  Equity representation choices move portfolio Sharpe; cryptocurrency ranking
  skill does not recover equity-like performance under retrain or frozen transfer.
references:
